            "review_text": "oztrader\nPetaling Jaya, Malaysia774 contributions\n0\nJelly Fish Noodle\nMar 2023 • Friends\nThe restaurant is simple in decorations,it is pretty famous and many local celebrities visited the shop. Service is friendly and nice, especially the boss himself.\nWe love the Jelly Fish rice noodle with chunk of Tuna breed fish, fish cake. The soup is clear and tasty,Jelly Fish is big and crunchy.But we find the fish cake slightly on the harder side.\nThe pork noodle comes with a pork on the bone,some meat balls and it is tasty,pork itself tender and flavourful.\nIf you are in Nha Trang, please do not miss it.\n4.5 Stars for me.\nRead more\nWritten March 2, 2023",
